<title>USA: CIT Group issues $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>CIT Group issues $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from</p>
<p>CIT Group Holdings was priced on Wednesday, according to sole</p>
<p>manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER CIT GROUP HOLDINGS</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 5.875 PCT  MATURITY 12/09/1999</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.877  FIRST PAY DATE 06/09/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3   YIELD 5.92 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD 23 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>NOTE: CIT GROUP HOLDINGS IS 80 PERCENT OWNED BY DAI-ICHI</p>
<p>KANGYO BANK LTD AND 20 PERCENT OWNED BY CHASE MANHATTAN CORP U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
